SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Samothrace\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island capital's big night: on the evening of 15 August the square of Chora\, under the castle\, hosts a traditional panigiri with local musicians and dancing. Chora keeps the Transfiguration (6 August) the same way. Both are busy with the August camping crowd from Therma\, so come up early for a seat.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samothrace/#chora-panigiri-of-the-dormition-chora
